# ~/.claude holds a lot of machine-local runtime state (transcripts, caches,
# session data, brew-installed hooks/skills). Ignore everything by default and
# opt files in explicitly, so new runtime dirs can never leak into the repo.
*

!.gitignore
!CLAUDE.md
!RTK.md
!settings.json
!statusline.sh

# NOT tracked on purpose:
#   projects/ history.jsonl sessions/ telemetry/  -- conversation contents
#   plugins/ cache/ backups/ file-history/        -- reproducible / large
#   hooks/peon-ping/ skills/peon-ping-*           -- `brew install peon-ping`
#   settings.local.json                           -- if ever added, keep local
